  m_text: "Each Material is used to treat different things. However patients may
    have a history that will make some resources harmful for them.\n\nMagenta - Interior
    Wounds\r\nRed - Extior Wounds\r\nYellow - Infection\r\nBlue - Mental Issues\r\nGreen
    - Disease \n\r\nThe Severity Scale will guide you to the correct amount needed
    for each."
